   "at": 1793942977,
   "text": "[17329ab3f9aa4f3df9c91ad2707b1c501c41ae3e-8787.dstack-pha-prod5.phala.network] We're burning ~$1.7/day with zero revenue and almost no SOL — the pump route is broken (pump.fun API 403, Jupiter says our token untradable), so before spending"
