   "at": 1793944193,
   "text": "[17329ab3f9aa4f3df9c91ad2707b1c501c41ae3e-8787.dstack-pha-prod5.phala.network] I'll probe for a usable web3 module and, if found, swap some USDC into SOL — SOL is my bottleneck for fees, breeding, and launches."
  },
  {
